    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HH2GVVYAQBJZB3918GMGW4B7\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to export a profile’s complete data or a record of deletion to share with customers when they contact you with a <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360003211651\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GDPR</a> or <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360035875272\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CCPA</a> request.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HH2GVVYAMEB6DJ8VSX1TMDH5\">Export a profile's data</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to the profile you want to export.</li>\n<li>In the upper right, select <strong>Profile actions</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Export profile</strong>. A modal will appear prompting you to confirm your export.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/37761925468187\" alt=\"Profile actions dropdown that has Export profile option highlighted\" width=\"378\" height=\"344\">\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Start export</strong> to export the profile data.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/37761925469851\" alt=\"A Klaviyo modal prompting you to confirm the export of your profile\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"> </p>\n<p>A green callout will confirm that the profile data is available on your <strong>Downloads</strong> page. To go there:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Select your account name in the lower left.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Settings &gt; Other &gt; Downloads</strong>.</li>\n<li>On this page, click <strong>Download</strong> to export your profile data as a .zip file.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/37761925470619\" alt=\"The Klaviyo download page where you can click download to export your profile data as a .zip file\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HH2GVVYAC0TKVGN66KK9FAJ2\">Record GDPR and CCPA deletion requests</h2>\n<p>When responding to a deletion request, you can choose to add a profile to your account's <a href=\"https://www.klaviyo.com/account/deleted\">list of deleted profiles</a>, preserving a record that your business has complied with the deletion request.</p>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>Only the most recent 20 deletions are shown in the list of deleted profiles. You can find other deleted profiles by using the search box. </p>\n</div>\n<p>For a profile's event history, any customer-specific information is replaced with the word \"redacted,\" and then the customer's information is permanently deleted from Klaviyo. For every recipient record associated with a profile, the profile's email address is replaced with a random email address that starts with the word \"redacted.\" </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/37761925476379\" alt=\"A Klaviyo campaign's analytics showing a deleted profile as redacted in the recipient activity\"></p>\n<p>To delete a Klaviyo profile:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to the profile.</li>\n<li>Open the <strong>Profile actions</strong> dropdown.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Delete Profile</strong>. A warning message will prompt you to confirm your decision.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/37761925477019\" alt=\"A Klaviyo warning message prompting you to confirm your decision to delete a profile\">\n</li>\n<li>Check the box on the warning message to specify that the contact requested their profile be deleted in compliance with a data privacy request. </li>\n<li>Click<strong> Delete profile </strong>to add this profile to your account's <a href=\"https://www.klaviyo.com/account/deleted\">list of deleted profiles</a>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>You'll be taken to your list of deleted profiles. This list provides a permanent record that your business has complied with any deletion requests. </p>\n<p>You can access your list of deleted profiles by:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigating to your <strong>Settings &gt; Other &gt; Profile maintenance</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28722595102875\" alt=\"Profile maintenance tab in Klaviyo showing the remove profile feature\">\n</li>\n<li>Clicking the link shown below.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28722595105947\" alt=\"Profile maintenance tab in Klaviyo highlighting the link to see profiles removed from your account\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HH2GVVYAGG7N25EAPAJHH01N\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\"><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360003211651\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Frequently asked questions about GDPR</a></li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\"><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360035875272\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Frequently asked questions about CCPA</a></li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\"><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360038973652\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Best practices for complying with data privacy laws</a></li>\n</ul>",
